1
00:00:00,297 --> 00:00:06,374
Runway Guard brings banking, Stripe payments, and accounting adapters into one finance workspace.

2
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:12,058
Owners can upload a CSV. Accepted rows enter the ledger and review queue immediately.

3
00:00:12,354 --> 00:00:15,679
The same controls work in Simplified Chinese.

4
00:00:15,975 --> 00:00:24,723
WeChat Pay and Alipay run consent-gated, read-only sandbox checks for merchant setup, settlement data, and signed callbacks.

5
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:29,048
Every result becomes exportable evidence. No payment moves.

